{"id":"63c5fb522cfc3aa0","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/078_G_3_i_相继式演算.md","title":"078 G 3 i 相继式演算","display":"078_G_3_i_相继式演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-G3i-命题语言\">1. G3i 命题语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{G3i}\">\\(Frm_{G3i}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(bot\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：相继式后件属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{G3i}\\cup\\{\\emptyset_s\\}\">\\(Frm_{G3i}\\cup\\{\\emptyset_s\\}\\)</span>，因此后件至多一个公式；这是直觉主义单结论 G3i。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式操作\">2. 公式操作</h1>\n<p>变元函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\qquad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\qquad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_{G3i}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3i}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_{G3i}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3i}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3i}\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3i}\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(bot)=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(bot)=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-单结论相继式\">3. 单结论相继式</h1>\n<p>前件上下文集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ctx_{G3i}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ctx_{G3i}=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后件集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Succ_{G3i}=Frm_{G3i}\\cup\\{\\emptyset_s\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Succ_{G3i}=Frm_{G3i}\\cup\\{\\emptyset_s\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_{G3i}=Ctx_{G3i}\\times Succ_{G3i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_{G3i}=Ctx_{G3i}\\times Succ_{G3i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\)</span>。G3i 的目标差异是后件至多含一个公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-初始与底规则\">4. 初始与底规则</h1>\n<p>初始关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{G3i}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p):p\\in Prop,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{G3i}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p):p\\in Prop,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{G3i}=Init_{G3i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{G3i}=Init_{G3i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底左规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\bot L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow S):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i}),S\\in Succ_{G3i}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\bot L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow S):\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_{G3i}),S\\in Succ_{G3i}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-合取与析取规则\">5. 合取与析取规则</h1>\n<p>合取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>析取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow S,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow S,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-蕴含规则\">6. 蕴含规则</h1>\n<p>蕴含右规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to R}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to R}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B),\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>蕴含左规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to L}^{G3i}\n=\n\\{((\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow A,\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow S),\\Gamma,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以上每个规则集合均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Seq_{G3i}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{G3i}\">\\(Seq_{G3i}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Seq_{G3i}\\)</span> 的子集，且集合中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{G3i}\">\\(Frm_{G3i}\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ctx_{G3i}\">\\(Ctx_{G3i}\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Succ_{G3i}\">\\(Succ_{G3i}\\)</span> 中。定义总规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{G3i}\n=\nRule_{\\bot L}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{G3i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{G3i}\n=\nRule_{\\bot L}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{G3i}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{G3i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-G3i-推导树\">7. G3i 推导树</h1>\n<p>G3i 推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}\\)</span> 刻画。没有原始弱化、收缩、交换或割规则。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_{G3i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to Seq_{G3i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_{G3i})\n\\lor\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land(\\varnothing,\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{\\bot L}^{G3i})\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3i})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3i}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_{G3i})\n\\lor\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land(\\varnothing,\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{\\bot L}^{G3i})\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3i})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_{G3i}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{G3i}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{G3i}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\in Seq_{G3i}:\\vdash_{G3i}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\in Seq_{G3i}:\\vdash_{G3i}\\Gamma\\Rightarrow S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{G3i}=(Succ_{G3i},Seq_{G3i},Rule_{G3i},\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i},\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{G3i}=(Succ_{G3i},Seq_{G3i},Rule_{G3i},\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i},\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{G3i}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{G3i},\nPV,\nSub_{G3i},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nCtx_{G3i},\nSucc_{G3i},\nSeq_{G3i},\nInit_{G3i},\nAx_{G3i},\nRule_{\\bot L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\to L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\to R}^{G3i},\nRule_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i},\n\\vdash_{G3i},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i},\n\\Delta_{G3i}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{G3i}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{G3i},\nPV,\nSub_{G3i},\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nCtx_{G3i},\nSucc_{G3i},\nSeq_{G3i},\nInit_{G3i},\nAx_{G3i},\nRule_{\\bot L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee R1}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\vee R2}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\to L}^{G3i},\nRule_{\\to R}^{G3i},\nRule_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{G3i},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{G3i},\n\\vdash_{G3i},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{G3i},\n\\Delta_{G3i}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含单结论 G3i 相继式、底左规则和直觉主义左右规则；不含多结论经典后件、原始结构规则、割规则或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-G3i-命题语言","text":"1. G3i 命题语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式操作","text":"2. 公式操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-单结论相继式","text":"3. 单结论相继式","level":1},{"id":"4.-初始与底规则","text":"4. 初始与底规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-合取与析取规则","text":"5. 合取与析取规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-蕴含规则","text":"6. 蕴含规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-G3i-推导树","text":"7. G3i 推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"bot\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_{G3i}\\cup\\{\\emptyset_s\\}","display":false},{"tex":"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\qquad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_{G3i}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{G3i}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_{G3i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\wideh